<h2>Administrator controls</h2>
<?php $applicant=one('SELECT email FROM users WHERE id=?',[$r['applicant_id']]);?><p>Applicant notification email: <b><?=e($applicant['email']??'Unavailable')?></b><br>DAA office notifications: <b>daa.cnr@rub.edu.bt</b>. DAA's own requests go to President.</p>
